  "content": "<h1>暗黑RPG主選單 - DarkMenu</h1><p><strong>功能說明</strong></p><p>源自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>模組包的主選單介面</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><p>(這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗)&nbsp;</p><p>此為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG模組包</a>的主選單介面。原本主要用於該模組包，現已開放給所有玩家使用。此模組將更換選單背景、選項背景及按鈕文字，營造更濃厚的RPG主題氛圍。最新版本更新增受《黑暗靈魂》啟發的死亡畫面。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/673/913/main-menu-screenshot-new.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/617/80/2023-02-04_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/673/155/2023-06-07_04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>即可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
